From 522e02874be044dde4ac4f7318b8a9e418f0c581 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 19:44:10 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: Expire the confirmation code and limit wrong
 attempts

The Event confirmation code is valid for 5 minutes and accepts 3 wrong
attempts. Wrong, expired and exhausted codes get distinct messages, and the
show page issues a new code when the old one is no longer valid. The clock
is injectable (epoch $now) so the rule is tested in the model without sleep.
---
